OL,3,AAt least 270 killed in Nepal as experts
OL,4,Awarn of possible second flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn both sides of the border, hundreds
OL,7,Fof foreign nationals are missing -
OL,8,FNepal says that includes 178 tourists
OL,9,Ffrom India, 127 from Nepal, 65
OL,10,FAmericans, 35 Australians, and 33 from
OL,11,Fthe UK
OL,13,FThe US Geological Survey says "glacial
OL,14,Fcollapse and debris flow" triggered the
OL,15,Ffloods - and there are fears of more
OL,16,Ffloods, with debris blocking rivers
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
